 "Every triangle satisfies ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraTriangleQ"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraTriangleQ", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
